SY_TALK("gxTEojYiTt8",[[10,["Requires translation of Marathi. See page 15"]],[10,["Public Program The Nabhi Chakra"]],[11,["New Delhi – India January 31, 1983"]],[950,["The music was very fine and elevating to all of you."]],[960,["The effect of music in Sahaja Yoga is tremendous,"]],[964,["and if a Sahaja Yogi sings the song"]],[969,["it's so great that it acts like a mantra upon My being."]],[976,["So I'm very thankful to Mrs. Venogopalan"]],[981,["for singing such a beautiful song today. It stirred Me completely."]],[987,["Then Gavin Brown was very sweet. He's an Englishman, very gentle"]],[993,["and a very steady Sahaja Yogi."]],[997,["He's one of the first Western Sahaja Yogis"]],[1001,["I met."]],[1006,["Today I will tell you about the Nabhi Chakra which deals"]],[1012,["with this honesty of seeking."]],[1018,["Nabhi Chakra is the center which controls"]],[1023,["or manifests outside in the gross as"]],[1030,["Solar Plexus. Nabhi Chakra has two sides: one is the left,"]],[1037,["another the right, and one in the center."]],[1044,["So on the left hand side is the Gruha Lakshmi,"]],[1048,["on the right hand side is the Raja Lakshmi"]],[1050,["or Gaja Lakshmi and in the center is the Lakshmi"]],[1055,["which ascends into Mahalakshmi."]],[1066,["When the seeking starts, a human being"]],[1076,["first starts seeking food."]],[1082,["Food is very important for all the animals. If they have no food"]],[1092,["then they cannot exist. So the seeking starts"]],[1100,["with food, and when the shelter is sought, they try to find the water."]],[1115,["So this center is made of water"]],[1123,["and in this center resides the Deity of Shri Vishnu or Narayana;"]],[1138,["and His power, as I told you, is Lakshmi and then Mahalakshmi."]],[1147,["You will find out in Sahaja Yoga"]],[1150,["that gradually you start developing one power and then the other."]],[1159,["Everyone who comes to Sahaja Yoga, if they are truthful"]],[1164,["and not involved with any wrong things,"]],[1170,["then definitely they are helped in Lakshmi Tattwa,"]],[1174,["means their well-being is looked after."]],[1178,["As Krishna has said, \"yogakshema vahaamya.\""]],[1182,["So He looks after the kshema part of it."]],[1186,["Everyone who has been to Sahaja Yoga"]],[1189,["has been helped miraculously"]],[1191,["also in the Lakshmi Tattwa, that means materially."]],[1196,["In so many ways they are helped,"]],[1198,["that one has to just see for themselves"]],[1200,["how these miracles take place."]],[1204,["An example is of a villager who had a small little holding of land"]],[1214,["and he was living hand to mouth every day."]],[1221,["When he came to Me, after some time I found"]],[1225,["he would bring one garland,"]],[1227,["big garland, for Me every evening."]],[1230,["And he was away in the village every day he would attend My program."]],[1234,["I was quite surprised that how could he afford it, and I asked him,"]],[1240,["\"How can you afford a garland for Me every day?"]],[1244,["You shouldn't bring it, it's not proper.\""]],[1248,["So he said, \"Mother, You know everything.\""]],[1250,["I said, \"Why, what happened?\""]],[1251,["He said, \"I have a plot of land next to mine"]],[1257,["which we never used because it was absolutely a barren land -"]],[1261,["little bit, not much big land, but a small land, piece of land."]],[1268,["And after Realization I used to always go"]],[1271,["walk over it bare feet to plough this little"]],[1275,["piece of land that I had."]],[1278,["After some time when I was coming here after that,"]],[1282,["one gentleman came to see me and he said that"]],[1286,["“This piece of land that you have is very precious.“"]],[1289,["He said, “What's the problem?” He said that"]],[1293,["“I have a kiln of bricks, and I have seen that even"]],[1301,["by chance – Sahaja - we mixed a little clay from this soil,"]],[1310,["from this part of the land that you have,"]],[1315,["and we found that our bricks have become so good and so strong"]],[1320,["that we would like to purchase"]],[1322,["this clay from you at the price of seers.\""]],[1328,["And that's how he started getting money sufficient"]],[1330,["for him and he became much better off."]],[1337,["But in Sahaja Yoga one has to remember you don't go to extremes,"]],[1342,["in any principle."]],[1343,["That is one thing people should know, that you don't go to extremes."]],[1348,["You don't become extremely rich."]],[1352,["I've seen those people who are extremely rich,"]],[1355,["when they come to Sahaja Yoga, they are a big headache,"]],[1358,["very big headache. If they are sick,"]],[1361,["if you cure them of their heart trouble,"]],[1365,["then they try to possess you."]],[1368,["They will get all the heart patients, they will get"]],[1370,["all kinds of patients to you,"]],[1372,["you go on tolerating it, they try to possess you."]],[1375,["They immediately start talking about their cures"]],[1377,["to everyone, they publish in papers, this thing, that thing,"]],[1380,["it's impossible. And they just try to overpower you."]],[1384,["Without any appointment"]],[1385,["they'll arrive and they would expect you to attend to them immediately,"]],[1388,["it's terrible."]],[1393,["And then they’ll send all their relations for cure"]],[1397,["and you have to show all patience,"]],[1399,["all their friends, they become like agents."]],[1403,["All their patients, all their relations, all their friends,"]],[1409,["they want to oblige them and spare"]],[1413,["no love, no affection, nothing further."]],[1418,["The Sahaja Yogis, if they try"]],[1422,["to say that “No, you shouldn't do like that and all that,\""]],[1425,["they feel insulted."]],[1428,["And they all try curing much faster"]],[1432,["than anybody else does."]],[1434,["They themselves are weak,"]],[1435,["they are sick people themselves,"]],[1437,["heart patient, this patient, that,"]],[1439,["but if you tell them, “Don't cure,” they'll feel bad."]],[1442,["If you don't tell them,"]],[1443,["they'll get sick and you'll have another problem."]],[1445,["They never try to understand Sahaja Yoga in it's big way."]],[1449,["They just want to see it according to their own way of ego"]],[1457,["that they have accumulated with their money,"]],[1461,["and they never know how they go on hurting"]],[1464,["everyone by overpowering Me all the time."]],[1471,["It's very amazing, whenever I cure a rich man,"]],[1475,["I've been wanting to run away from that person."]],[1478,["I would never go to their house, I would not like to eat in their house."]],[1481,["It's a very bad thing."]],[1486,["So too much of riches is also not okay"]],[1491,["because it gives you a tremendous"]],[1494,["ego that you don't see yourself,"]],[1496,["and anybody tries to say anything protect oneself,"]],[1499,["then such a person feels insulted or humiliated."]],[1503,["Not only that, but they try to hold Me and hold the whole thing"]],[1508,["according to their business ways which is impossible."]],[1513,["See, they have to gain money,"]],[1515,["they have another attitude because they are miserly."]],[1518,["I don't have to earn money or anything."]],[1520,["If I am doing anything, I’m, really,"]],[1523,["in a way, I'm obliging. Isn't it?"]],[1526,["But they will force on Me all their rules and regulations, everything,"]],[1529,["without having their own discipline."]],[1532,["So very rich people in Sahaja Yoga"]],[1535,["so far have been extremely troublesome,"]],[1539,["I should say, to Me and to the whole organization."]],[1542,["They are very narrow-minded."]],[1545,["They cannot see the big vision that I have before Me."]],[1551,["Whatever little ideas they have about themselves and about their"]],[1555,["own thinking, reading, they will try to push onto Sahaja Yoga."]],[1560,["It's not My experience once, but many a times."]],[1562,["Then somehow or other it so happens that they drop out."]],[1568,["So, too much richness gives you a tremendous ego, worse than"]],[1572,["even, I would say, a bulldog."]],[1576,["It’s impossible for a rich man to see"]],[1579,["that all these riches are outside him. They are not inside him."]],[1585,["He has to be rich in heart to understand compassion."]],[1590,["Compassion doesn't mean that you give alms to others,"]],[1593,["or if you give money to others, it's not that."]],[1597,["On the contrary, you just have beggars by doing that."]],[1602,["Compassion is that works,"]],[1606,["compassion is that flows,"]],[1610,["compassion is that manifests."]],[1613,["It is not in compassion where you can make it materialize it,"]],[1616,["“All right, come along I'll give you a hundred rupees.”"]],[1620,["On the contrary, giving somebody a hundred rupees is the worst thing."]],[1625,["I have tried this with some Sahaja Yogis who were with Me."]],[1628,["I tried to give them some money some time as they were very poor."]],[1632,["They became horrid."]],[1637,["Some of them started drinking,"]],[1640,["some of them took to some other ways and they became"]],[1642,["sort of addicted to money. It was impossible."]],[1645,["And they tried to spoil as many Sahaj Yogis as they could."]],[1651,["So such people if they come, it's impossible to manage them."]],[1657,["They are not Sahaja Yogis because they are asahaja."]],[1660,["They are still sticking to the idea that they have so much money,"]],[1664,["that they are so rich and they can overpower everyone with money."]],[1668,["Not Me, I'm sorry."]],[1674,["But only thing I feel sorry for them that they cannot get to God."]],[1682,["There is no honesty of seeking in them, there is no honesty of seeking."]],[1689,["The elite people whom I have addressed"]],[1692,["so many places like this, because"]],[1695,["some people whom I have cured wanted Me to address the elite,"]],[1699,["so-called. I think they are elated, to Me what they are."]],[1704,["They don't want to be in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1707,["They are already eliminated, I sometimes feel."]],[1709,["Thousands of them I've addressed, I've wasted My time with them."]],[1713,["They are good for nothing, absolutely empty people."]],[1721,["They are very happy because they have a few cars,"]],[1723,["or some houses or something like that."]],[1726,["I too have all these things, I would say so-called riches."]],[1731,["I have always seen from My father's side"]],[1734,["and from My husband's side."]],[1736,["I don't understand what is there to be proud of this emptiness."]],[1741,["But human beings are such, a empty vessel makes a big sound,"]],[1747,["in the same way, an empty rich man makes a very big sound."]],[1756,["Not that the very poor are also good,"]],[1761,["because those who are extremely poor"]],[1764,["are busy with their food problems."]],[1767,["They have little, little problems and their values are still have to"]],[1770,["come up to a point."]],[1772,["It's only in the middle you can work out Sahaja Yoga better."]],[1777,["Those who are extremely rich and proud"]],[1779,["cannot come to Sahaja Yoga easily."]],[1782,["Those who are very poor also cannot come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1786,["But when this middle part of the river is enriched"]],[1792,["and starts flowing well, then it spreads on the sides"]],[1795,["and then it can engulf."]],[1797,["But you cannot  start it the other way round. I have tried."]],[1800,["I have tried both ways"]],[1801,["and I have told you what happened."]],[1803,["Whom I gave money,"]],[1805,["whom I tried to help through giving money"]],[1807,["became wayward, useless, frivolous people,"]],[1811,["got lost to Sahaja Yoga. And those whom I thought"]],[1817,["were moneyed and satisfied people"]],[1819,["had another role to play is to possess Me all the time,"]],[1823,["to use Me all the time whenever they wanted,"]],[1826,["for whatever purpose they wanted to use Me."]],[1833,["And they must know, you cannot possess Me, you cannot possess Me,"]],[1838,["but this kind of an ignorance"]],[1840,["still in their minds is that they can possess God,"]],[1842,["they can possess everyone."]],[1846,["For such people there are no reasons"]],[1853,["to come to Sahaja Yoga, to be very frank."]],[1856,["And even if they come to Sahaja Yog"]],[1859,["they have to know that for Mother richness of heart,"]],[1863,["understanding of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1866,["humility, non-possessiveness are very important."]],[1875,["In this ascent of yours, money is not important at all."]],[1885,["Even if you are poor or rich, you get your Realization."]],[1889,["For example, I went to Maharashtra, most of them are,"]],[1895,["I would say, very poor people"]],[1898,["in the sense that"]],[1900,["they are not middle class at all. They are not educated,"]],[1904,["they are sometimes factory workers"]],[1907,["or they have small holdings. Not very rich."]],[1913,["But they are very good Sahaja Yogis, excellent Sahaja Yogis."]],[1917,["They have such beautiful eyes"]],[1920,["and such beautiful feeling and such compassion"]],[1925,["that Lakshmi Tattwa is absolutely balanced in them."]],[1933,["You know that Lakshmi is shown to be a lady,"]],[1938,["and lady who is a mother."]],[1942,["Mother doesn't care whether you are rich or poor."]],[1946,["If her one son is rich and another is poor,"]],[1949,["she'll pay more attention to the poor and ask the rich"]],[1953,["to give his money to the poor also."]],[1956,["She is not bothered. If somebody is in need,"]],[1960,["she will be the first to help the person who needs."]],[1963,["Now this is a spiritual thing in the spiritual life."]],[1968,["The person who is a real seeker,"]],[1970,["who is a truthful seeker, the Mother will go out of the way"]],[1976,["to be with that person. And those who are not honest about it,"]],[1981,["Mother will try somehow or other cut them short."]],[1989,["The problem that lies with human beings is"]],[1995,["that they do not know what they want."]],[1999,["They think they want first of all money."]],[2002,["But those who have money,"]],[2004,["they think they must have power."]],[2006,["If they have too much money, they think that they must go into politics"]],[2009,["because they have had no power."]],[2011,["Then they fail in politics, or say they become too much in politics,"]],[2015,["whatever it is, then they want love from their children"]],[2020,["which they can't get, because they are too busy or something like that."]],[2025,["So they don't know what they want."]],[2029,["Those who believe that by having money will be better off,"]],[2033,["should listen to all these people who have come from affluent countries"]],[2036,["and they will tell you"]],[2037,["how things have gone wrong there,"]],[2039,["how people are ruined, what's going wrong with them,"]],[2041,["absolutely they are in a bad shape."]],[2046,["You cannot call them human beings"]],[2049,["because they are so cruel, they kill even their own children,"]],[2052,["and that society tolerates such people."]],[2055,["In India if you hear somebody"]],[2057,["killing a child,"]],[2058,["I have never heard so far in the sixty years of My life,"]],[2061,["but supposing you hear someone has killed his daughter or son,"]],[2066,["nobody will ever look at that person."]],[2068,["He will not be allowed in the society, nobody will even"]],[2071,["give any girl in the marriage to"]],[2076,["his daughter or a son. He'll be absolutely barred from the society."]],[2081,["No one can think of such a relationship between children and parents."]],[2086,["And then there are funny relationships also,"]],[2089,["it's something so absurd,"]],[2091,["on both the sides on cruelty and on morality,"]],[2094,["they are so absurd, it's impossible to understand."]],[2098,["So money has given this ego and they say, “What's wrong?"]],[2103,["What’s wrong?” It's absolutely malignant attitude."]],[2107,["When you say, “What's wrong?” that means"]],[2109,["you do not want to keep your relationship with the whole."]],[2114,["You do not want to keep your relationship"]],[2117,["with the Primordial One, the One who has you,"]],[2125,["everyone within Himself. You are part and parcel of the whole,"]],[2129,["and how can you say, “What's wrong?"]],[2131,["I do what I like.” You just become like a malignant cell."]],[2137,["So at the Nabhi Chakra one has to know"]],[2141,["that one should not hanker after money too much."]],[2146,["Now those who hanker too much after money,"]],[2150,["may develop their right side better, they may have money, no doubt."]],[2157,["But they miss their left side. Left side is Gruha Lakshmi,"]],[2163,["they have no Gruha Lakshmi in their house."]],[2165,["They are very hectic people, they run about,"]],[2168,["they run the rat race, they get heart attacks,"]],[2171,["if not heart attacks, they will get leukemia,"]],[2175,["they'll get diabetes, liver, all such things,"]],[2182,["because their attention is on money and not on God."]],[2186,["So either you are on the right or on the left."]],[2193,["Those who are very emotional people,"]],[2195,["extremely emotional, more worried about their family;"]],[2199,["for them family is everything,"]],[2201,["the relations are everything, they are like that,"]],[2204,["they may not have so much of Lakshmi because they distribute"]],[2206,["all the Lakshmi. But still they are better people. But sometimes"]],[2213,["such people who sacrifice"]],[2214,["so much for others,"]],[2216,["give up everything that they have, can become crazy"]],[2220,["because they’ll find people do not reciprocate,"]],[2223,["they do not return their love,"]],[2225,["they do not understand what they have done."]],[2228,["So going to the extreme of helping others can cause"]],[2231,["trouble to the person who does this job, and also trouble to people"]],[2235,["who have taken free money from him,"]],[2237,["because if you distribute free money to people what will happen?"]],[2240,["I'll give you a simple example of America helping India."]],[2246,["When Americans helped India,"]],[2249,["they thought they were doing a great favor to Indians,"]],[2251,["which was a wrong thing. Because whatever they did"]],[2254,["whatever they did was lost in the wilderness."]],[2258,["Nobody tried to maintain it, it was free."]],[2263,["But by giving that they showed the contempt,"]],[2267,["and when they gave some wheat and rice to India"]],[2271,["there was no grace about it, because"]],[2274,["then put some sort of a seed in it"]],[2276,["which creted two horrible things in the villages."]],[2280,["One was called as congress grass"]],[2283,["because it came from America."]],[2285,["And another was called as a mad acacia."]],[2291,["Babool, as we call it, mad babool. These trees"]],[2295,["have gown so much in the villages"]],[2297,["that they don't know what to do with them."]],[2300,["They have such big, big thorns that anyone who is stung by them"]],[2303,["can even die. They are very poisonous"]],[2306,["and if the children get it,"]],[2308,["they get such poisonous problems that they cannot be cured."]],[2313,["This is how American government has helped us."]],[2316,["Now who's going to tell them what you have done so ungraciously?"]],[2320,["It was better to starve than to get any help from anyone."]],[2325,["Long time back I had said that it is better to starve in this country"]],[2329,["than to get any help from these wretched, horrible"]],[2333,["Western countries who think no end of themselves."]],[2337,["You just pamper their ego for nothing at all."]],[2340,["What have they got? They have just plastic affluence."]],[2343,["But this ego out of money makes them so stupid"]],[2348,["that they don't know what's happening in their own country."]],[2351,["How their country’s going down in every way."]],[2354,["How their people are going down. Either they are in"]],[2357,["fear or they are abandoned."]],[2360,["Otherwise they are communist"]],[2362,["or they are so-called capitalist"]],[2365,["where they are just abandoned."]],[2367,["If you go and see that country,"]],[2369,["I mean you can't sit like this anywhere and talk in the outside,"]],[2373,["somebody might come and murder somebody."]],[2376,["If you walk in the dark you can be murdered."]],[2378,["In America, so called advanced country of America, in New York City."]],[2386,["So this kind of riches we are trying to aspire, especially"]],[2389,["people in Delhi are very anxious to aspire lot of money."]],[2394,["I don't know why Punjabis, Gujaratis"]],[2398,["and Maarwadis have taken to this."]],[2400,["Maarwadis are another style."]],[2404,["How the Punjabis and the Gujaratis"]],[2408,["are trying to acquire the money."]],[2411,["And when I see them abroad I"]],[2414,["just don't know if they are anywhere near India."]],[2417,["Horrid people they. They have no culture left in them that is Indian."]],[2424,["They are absolutely outward."]],[2427,["They think no end of themselves,"]],[2429,["they think they have reached the heavens."]],[2433,["Then if you see their Nabhi Chakra,"]],[2435,["you'll be amazed, all of them suffer from horrible livers,"]],[2438,["high blood pressure, diabetes, heart attacks"]],[2443,["and they drink like fish, especially Sardargis."]],[2447,["I was surprised who are supposed to be in the name of God,"]],[2452,["they drink like fish."]],[2456,["They are very particular about wearing a Puggadi and a Dhari,"]],[2459,["but while drinking they don't mind."]],[2461,["Every Sardargi you go to has a big bar in his house,"]],[2465,["where even a lord"]],[2466,["does not have because it is regarded as very vulgar in England."]],[2469,["Without learning any aesthetics of that country,"]],[2473,["they have become just like a agriculture there is no culture"]],[2482,["is the fact,"]],[2484,["this is what money has done to them, they have"]],[2486,["no respect for themselves."]],[2489,["So this Lakshmi Tattwa is to be balanced. Same about these"]],[2493,["Gujaratis who have gone."]],[2495,["Another kind lives here, the Maarwadis."]],[2497,["Less said the better about these horrible Maarwadis."]],[2501,["I don't think anyone of them will ever get Realization"]],[2504,["or a place in the Kingdom of God."]],[2509,["They are blood suckers."]],[2513,["They are not human beings. For money's sake, they'll"]],[2516,["suck the blood like juice, suck the blood, and now they had a nice time."]],[2525,["This is not a world for you to seek money."]],[2531,["You have come on this earth as a human being"]],[2533,["to seek God, to seek your Spirit, to be one with your Self,"]],[2537,["to be in that peaceful place"]],[2540,["which is the Kingdom of God, which is the Kingdom of Heaven,"]],[2545,["and not to jump into a mire"]],[2548,["which looks very beautiful"]],[2552,["but is not really beautiful. It's agonizing, it's terrorizing."]],[2559,["People can't sleep if they have too much money,"]],[2562,["because they don't know what to do with that."]],[2564,["Here also all those who have got money,"]],[2567,["they don't know when the income tax will come on them."]],[2571,["I have solved My income tax problem by having no income at all."]],[2578,["I have no income, no income tax,"]],[2580,["so I'm not worried about the Income Tax Commissioner."]],[2583,["He cannot control Me."]],[2587,["Best is not to have more income"]],[2590,["that is to be taxed, otherwise you’ll have"]],[2592,["to have another income tax"]],[2596,["lawyer that My brother is."]],[2599,["I told him, “I don't need you at all, all My life, thank you very much.”"]],[2604,["You get so absolutely free, on top of the world if you have no income."]],[2613,["Like if you want to solve your car problem, never learn driving."]],[2621,["Somebody drives you down or nothing, you can walk with your feet."]],[2628,["The accumulation of all these nonsensical things"]],[2631,["have caused us all this tension, so-called:"]],[2636,["“How much we have to pay, what is the income tax,"]],[2640,["tomorrow the police is going to come in my house?”"]],[2643,["If they come to Me I'll say, “All right,"]],[2645,["have everything that you can. Nothing there,"]],[2649,["certain bills which I have not paid, that's all.” Just let them pay."]],[2657,["One has to live with complete freedom in this world."]],[2660,["And to achieve that freedom, one has to know that"]],[2664,["the priorities should be all right. If money is your priority,"]],[2668,["you have it. No, not Me. If you want to give Me money,"]],[2674,["“No Sir,” I won't at any cost."]],[2678,["You can give Me flowers, this, that, all right, but no money at all."]],[2684,["I don't want to know about money at all, it's a headache."]],[2691,["In the same way, we do not realize that having relationships -"]],[2700,["brother, sister or son, this and that - is another big headache."]],[2708,["That doesn't mean that you should start beating them,"]],[2711,["but people can sell their country for the sake of their children."]],[2718,["It’s a very dangerous thing, horrible,"]],[2722,["that kind of an attachment, the mamatva (ownership)."]],[2725,["This is my son, finished."]],[2727,["If he's your son then you can murder anyone you feel like,"]],[2730,["you can do what you like because he is your son."]],[2733,["He is not somebody's son whom you are murdering?"]],[2738,["This mamatva that comes - “My husband.”"]],[2741,["Specially our Indian women."]],[2743,["“My husband” immediately starts problem."]],[2751,["All this comes out of ignorance. Of course, love has to be there."]],[2759,["But love never gives you attachment,"]],[2762,["because it is wise, it is wisdom. Supposing in a tree the sap of the tree"]],[2770,["goes and gets fixed in one fruit because it loves. “It's mine.”"]],[2776,["Then what happens to the rest of the tree? It dies"]],[2779,["and that fruit also dies."]],[2785,["So this mamatva has to go out."]],[2788,["But by telling it will not go,"]],[2792,["by just advising it will not go."]],[2794,["Even if you suffer, I have seen so many people coming to Me,"]],[2797,["“My own father deceived me."]],[2801,["My own son deceived me.” I said, “Which one is your own?"]],[2805,["The one who deceived you is not your own.”"]],[2811,["“My husband.”"]],[2813,["There are some ladies who eat My head out of their husbands."]],[2818,["“My husband did this, my husband did this, my husband did this.”"]],[2823,["Baba, why don't you hit him hard and finish with it?"]],[2829,["But it's so much accepted, this mamatva, this attachment."]],[2839,["Attachment to money, attachment to people, attachment to this"]],[2846,["is nothing but a hook which hooks you to baser levels."]],[2854,["You have to rise above, and then you really enjoy the beauty of richness."]],[2864,["As I told you the other day, I see all beautiful things."]],[2868,["It's nice I don't possess them. See now these carpets are spread here."]],[2873,["If they were Mine, I should worry, “Oh God, now"]],[2876,["I hope they are not going to be spoilt."]],[2879,["I hope nobody sits on them."]],[2882,["I hope they are insured, so nobody runs away with that.”"]],[2887,["But when they don't belong to Me, I'm enjoying them better."]],[2892,["Other people's things is a better idea."]],[2896,["This myth carries us to such an extent of stupidity"]],[2904,["that sometimes I feel whether these human beings are human beings,"]],[2908,["or they are their possessions. Their Spirit is lost,"]],[2915,["everything is lost, they're not bothered."]],[2920,["But if their little position is lost, they weep and wail,"]],[2924,["as if they are dead, their forefathers are dead hundred times."]],[2933,["But people like Me are just batchas, emperors."]],[2937,["They are not bothered. To them comfort cannot capture,"]],[2945,["they don’t need any comfort. If you have comfort"]],[2949,["it crawls upon you, it makes you a slave, too."]],[2953,["If you seek comfort you are in for enslavement,"]],[2958,["take it from Me. Any kind of comfort."]],[2965,["It's only human beings who can become really so crazy."]],[2968,["No animal can become. There is another type of a comfort,"]],[2973,["is that a mental idea"]],[2978,["that everybody must appreciate,"]],[2981,["and that you should be able to overpower others."]],[2984,["This also comes I think from Nabhi Chakra."]],[2989,["Is a kind of a feeling"]],[2990,["that you should be able to overpower many people,"]],[2993,["they should look at you."]],[2994,["These days in London there are women who are suffering from"]],[2998,["a funny disease called anorexia, where they just don't eat."]],[3002,["Women just don't eat because they should be thin and skinny."]],[3006,["For what? For what you should be thin and skinny?"]],[3010,["Because you look attractive, but for what?"]],[3015,["I don't think skinny people look attractive by any chance."]],[3019,["Horrible they are. They create only pity"]],[3022,["and you feel you know repulsive about the whole stuff."]],[3027,["Once a beauty queen came to see Me. I thought she was a T.B. patient."]],[3036,["And I said, “You look all right but it seems you are a T.B. patient.”"]],[3040,["She said, “No Mother, I've got a beauty prize.” “Yes?"]],[3045,["Who were the people? Doctors must have given it"]],[3048,["because they want some patients there.”"]],[3051,["This is the trouble,"]],[3053,["we go out of the way to trouble our Nabhi,"]],[3057,["not to eat your food, fasting."]],[3060,["If you want to fast this life, next life you will not have any food."]],[3065,["Thank you very much. No food."]],[3069,["Fasting? All right, you’ll have a permanent fasting. What do you say?"]],[3074,["You don't have to do any fasting. Why do you want to fast?"]],[3078,["And even if you want to fast"]],[3080,["because you want to change the timing or maybe"]],[3085,["for your health's sake, it's all right."]],[3087,["But why in the name of God you want to malign Me?"]],[3091,["You have got everything to eat and you don’t want to eat."]],[3094,["Those who have got food to eat, they don’t want to eat."]],[3096,["Next life they become poor and then they blame the rich."]],[3101,["But in last life you'd been wanted to fast,"]],[3106,["so this life you are not given any food, because you asked for it."]],[3112,["And that is how also the Nabhi Chakra gets you twisted,"]],[3116,["when you fast like mad."]],[3118,["There is no need to fast in the name of God."]],[3121,["God has given you all the wealth, all the beauty,"]],[3127,["all the love. Actually in Sahaja Yoga"]],[3131,["if you fast in My name, I think it's horrible"]],[3135,["because if you want to trouble your Mother"]],[3138,["or to make Her uneasy,"]],[3141,["or to take a revenge on Her,"]],[3143,["then you say, “Mother, I'm not going to eat my food.”"]],[3145,["Then Mother is finished. That's the best way to conquer Her."]],[3148,["To say, “Mother I'm not going to eat my food.”"]],[3151,["So this kind of a mad fasting"]],[3154,["is also very bad for your Nabhi and when you do that"]],[3158,["then you have a problem because you are invaded"]],[3161,["by your left-sided, what you call, beyond"]],[3168,["the Ida Nadi, you have the collective subconscious;"]],[3173,["and you are invaded by them."]],[3177,["And you are in for trouble, physically, mentally, emotionally."]],[3184,["And mostly those people who fast are very hot tempered."]],[3188,["The day they are fasting day is there, never go near them."]],[3192,["Because they are already planning what they are going to eat."]],[3199,["And in the morning they plan and they don't get it,"]],[3203,["so they are very angry for that part."]],[3207,["All these asahaja things are not going to help you."]],[3211,["You have to be normal people."]],[3213,["You don't have to put up into tension yourself for Sahaja Yoga, nothing."]],[3217,["Be normal. Be nice people. Don't torture yourself."]],[3222,["That is one point on the Nabhi on the left hand side"]],[3225,["and on the right hand side: don't get into indulgences."]],[3230,["Don't pamper yourself."]],[3232,["Both things are the same for Sahaja Yoga."]],[3234,["Whether you starve or you overeat, is the same."]],[3239,["There is no difference between the two, because"]],[3243,["if you are not on the seat,"]],[3244,["whether you are on the left"]],[3245,["falling on the right, does it make any difference?"]],[3250,["So to be on the seat is to be"]],[3253,["in the blessings of Shri Lakshmi."]],[3256,["And I have described to you how Shri Lakshmi is a lady"]],[3260,["and in Her left hand She has got two lotuses and the right,"]],[3266,["one lotus, and right hand another lotus on top, which shows a person"]],[3273,["who is balancing. She’s balancing on a lotus."]],[3277,["Imagine. She’s standing on a lotus. That means She is balancing."]],[3283,["And She’s balancing, She’s standing there"]],[3287,["and She is holding two lotuses in Her hand showing"]],[3293,["that She’s like a lotus."]],[3298,["A person who is a rich man, Lakshmi Pati,"]],[3303,["has to be like a lotus, warm, pink, warm."]],[3308,["And even a horrible thing, like"]],[3318,["wasp-like thing."]],[3320,["I don’t know what you call it in English, you don’t have that black thing."]],[3324,["We have a very black wasp, you see,"]],[3326,["which is hard, hard like nut and has angular thorny legs."]],[3332,["That black thing comes in"]],[3337,["and is good for nothing, but it comes in"]],[3343,["for the residence, for the ashraya,"]],[3347,["the lotus keeps it"]],[3350,["on top of it’s corolla, which is a very, very soft thing, with all love."]],[3355,["And in the night it closes down so that"]],[3358,["the poor insect who is just like a nut"]],[3361,["should not get any trouble from the outside weather."]],[3367,["Like a mother who takes the child in the armchair,"]],[3372,["that love should be there for a Lakshmi Pati."]],[3377,["How many are Lakshmi Pati’s like that? Have you seen any?"]],[3381,["If they see somebody who is coming with money propositions,"]],[3386,["then they may open their doors."]],[3388,["Otherwise, they have no love for anybody."]],[3391,["For those who come for their ashrayas, for their help,"]],[3397,["they are not there. On the other side"]],[3402,["are the people who are so repulsive. They are not like lotus."]],[3414,["There is no fragrance. They are such miserly people"]],[3419,["that they stink of miserliness. While the lotus"]],[3426,["gives its fragrance through that mud, to that horrible thing"]],[3433,["that even the little worms which crawl upon"]],[3439,["those lotus petals smell of this beautiful fragrance."]],[3448,["This is what it has to be. It has to give."]],[3452,["It has to be beautiful. It has to be cozy."]],[3455,["It has to be welcoming."]],[3458,["Then another hand is giving."]],[3463,["The Lakshmi is always giving. She doesn’t receive;"]],[3466,["She just gives."]],[3468,["If you are really a Lakshmi Pati"]],[3470,["you don’t want to have anything from anyone."]],[3472,["You don’t receive. If you are really rich, who can enrich you more?"]],[3479,["What can you give to a person who is fully rich? There is no"]],[3484,["way of entering into it now it’s all up to the brim."]],[3487,["He’s rich up to the brim. Then what do you give?"]],[3491,["You cannot give anything."]],[3492,["But where you have to give means that he’s a beggar –"]],[3496,["he’s still a beggar."]],[3500,["All of these so-called rich people"]],[3502,["who still are hankering money"]],[3503,["are still beggars, they are not rich."]],[3506,["They may think themselves. Empty vessels, but they are not rich"]],[3509,["because they are still expecting money."]],[3517,["So, it is important that we should understand,"]],[3526,["the money is not the way."]],[3528,["Money takes us away from dharma."]],[3530,["It takes us away from God."]],[3532,["It takes us away from reality. It covers our eyes."]],[3536,["We don’t think"]],[3538,["that we have to follow a path of righteousness and of virtue"]],[3543,["because we think we are rich, God is going to be afraid of us."]],[3546,["We can even purchase Him and can"]],[3548,["manage Him by giving some bribes."]],[3552,["That’s not so."]],[3555,["You must face yourself. You have to face yourself."]],[3559,["That it’s not the money that’s going to give you that elation,"]],[3565,["that higher life, but it is the love of God,"]],[3574,["the honesty of seeking, honesty."]],[3579,["That is the quality of this chakra is the Satya,"]],[3585,["Vishnu, is the Satya."]],[3588,["He’s the Narayana. Narayana means Satya."]],[3592,["So there cannot be Satya Narayan, isn’t it?"]],[3595,["Narayan is Satya, then how can there be Satya Narayan?"]],[3598,["But we have many Satya Narayana Pujas."]],[3602,["For all these Satya Narayanas, Sahaja Yogis are not supposed to go."]],[3606,["They can only go to Narayana Puja"]],[3609,["because Satya Narayana is that path which is added to it"]],[3614,["for camouflaging, is meant for these"]],[3617,["horrible Brahmins who make you pay. For what?"]],[3625,["Sahaja Yogis are not allowed to go to Satya Narayana Puja."]],[3629,["They can have Narayana Puja. And what is Narayana ultimately becomes?"]],[3635,["In the Nabhi Chakra Narayana existed since He was created by the Devi."]],[3645,["And It looks after"]],[3648,["the seeking, the nourishing of the seeking like a father,"]],[3653,["and then It incarnates again and then It incarnates again"]],[3657,["to help our seeking to a higher position and a higher position"]],[3662,["till it reaches a point where you start seeking God Almighty."]],[3671,["Then you jump into the Shakti of Mahalakshmi."]],[3676,["Then you are in the hands of Mahalakshmi Shakti."]],[3681,["Means Lakshmi evolves into Mahalakshmi principle."]],[3689,["Now this Mahalakshmi principle resides in the central path of Sushumna."]],[3697,["And this central path of Sushumna is to be established fully"]],[3707,["and awakened when the Kundalini rises."]],[3710,["When the Kundalini does not rise,"]],[3713,["this path is kept absolutely black."]],[3718,["It is absolutely black, there is nothing in it except for the deities"]],[3725,["who are lying without any light."]],[3730,["When the Kundalini rises, then only these deities get awakened"]],[3735,["and when they get awakened this Sushumna path,"]],[3739,["this central path of Mahalakshmi starts acting"]],[3747,["as the balancing power, to begin with at the Nabhi chakra."]],[3753,["So Nabhi Chakra is surrounded by ten Gurus, the Prophets"]],[3759,["who give you the balance,"]],[3761,["who come on this earth again and again to give you balance in life."]],[3766,["They tell you, “don’t do this, don’t do that.”"]],[3769,["But we don’t listen, we don’t accept it. We may say"]],[3773,["that we follow such guru, such guru. Like,"]],[3776,["you know Muslims are. They say, “We follow Mohammed Sahib.”"]],[3780,["Now if Mohammed Sahib has said"]],[3782,["anything it is that don’t drink, is the thing he said."]],[3786,["But I’ve yet to come across a Muslim who doesn’t drink."]],[3789,["They may not drink in Riyad because they’ll be killed there."]],[3792,["But if they come to London, they drink."]],[3794,["Actually, when My husband"]],[3796,["went to Saudi Arabia they said,"]],[3798,["“You are the only Muslim we have ever come across.”"]],[3801,["It’s true. Whatever is said to them, they do just the opposite of that."]],[3807,["At that time there were no cigarettes, no tobaccos,"]],[3810,["so He didn’t say about that"]],[3812,["so they have found a loophole."]],[3813,["Muslims smoke, doesn’t matter, because Mohammed Sahib never said."]],[3817,["Mohammed Sahib had to take another birth"]],[3820,["to come as Guru Nanaka to tell them, “Oh, God."]],[3823,["Now you are smoking this horrible thing has come, now you don’t smoke.”"]],[3830,["But who will accept that Nanaka and Mohammed Sahib were the same people?"]],[3835,["No difference. Same thing it was. We can prove it in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3844,["We can prove it, how important it is that we should know"]],[3849,["that they were all the same,"]],[3851,["and that they stood for the same thing,"]],[3854,["but at a period."]],[3855,["Now today you have got ganja,"]],[3858,["I don’t know the names also of all these things what you"]],[3861,["drink and smoke,"]],[3861,["God knows what."]],[3863,["Human beings are really clever"]],[3865,["to get everything that can destroy you. It's like,"]],[3868,["call a bull, “come and hit me.” It's like that. If there’s"]],[3870,["not a bull then you’ll like ask a buffalo, “come and hit me.”"]],[3873,["Now there's no buffalo, all right,"]],[3875,["you ask an elephant, “come and stampede me.” It's like that."]],[3878,["Human beings are so stupid."]],[3880,["So now supposing, I say"]],[3882,["if I write down a list of"]],[3883,["all the thing you drink and smoke, I don't know how many things"]],[3886,["there are in this world,"]],[3888,["then you'll find out the third thing when I die,"]],[3890,["that “Mataji didn't say this one.” So we should do it."]],[3895,["Very intelligent. All the time destroying your central path,"]],[3902,["and nicely managing through that."]],[3905,["Is this the way are you going to go to God by any chance?"]],[3909,["Is this the way are you following"]],[3911,["the great incarnations who came on this earth?"]],[3917,["So the balancing comes through Nabhi"]],[3921,["and Nabhi looks after you and teaches you how to behave."]],[3929,["For example, now your left Nabhi is Gruha Lakshmi."]],[3934,["Gruha Lakshmi is the Deity of the household."]],[3938,["But if you have too much outward type,"]],[3940,["you're running a madness."]],[3942,["So early in the morning you get up, read the newspapers."]],[3945,["Is against Sahaja Yoga again."]],[3947,["Not to read newspapers in the morning time."]],[3950,["You can read it in the night,"]],[3953,["but not in the morning. Because if you read it in the morning,"]],[3956,["you'll get upset."]],[3958,["And poor this spleen has to"]],[3960,["pour in more red blood corpuscles"]],[3963,["and it becomes mad and fails you."]],[3967,["On the contrary, in the morning talk to your wife,"]],[3969,["talk to your children,"]],[3970,["look after your Gruha Lakshmi Tattwa."]],[3972,["The wife also has to be a Gruha Lakshmi as I told you."]],[3976,["Then you have your food properly."]],[3979,["Sit down and eat properly. But no,"]],[3984,["just after that, upsetting that Nabhi,"]],[3986,["you jump into your car,"]],[3988,["taking your breakfast in your hand, eating on the way,"]],[3991,["honking at people, getting angry with them,"]],[3996,["the wife is calling, “Come along you have your breakfast!”"]],[3998,["Nothing doing. You are on your way on a special work,"]],[4003,["you end up with leukemia at least, minimum of minimum,"]],[4007,["if not with heart attack."]],[4010,["Leukemia comes from left Nabhi, when your Gruha Lakshmi is ruined."]],[4019,["The Deity of Gruha Lakshmi is Fatimabai,"]],[4022,["the daughter of Mohammed Sahib,"]],[4026,["while the daughter of the sister"]],[4034,["of Nanak Sahib is on the left Vishuddhi. You'll see that."]],[4043,["Nanaki. Now this aspect of life we never think about."]],[4050,["When you get leukemia, then you'll come to Mother, “please cure me.”"]],[4053,["And if you are rich,"]],[4054,["you will see to it that I cure that person."]],[4057,["If I don't cure you will sit on My head."]],[4059,["You'll be in ten times on My head unless and until I cure your leukemia."]],[4063,["But if I tell you, “My son, you take it easy,"]],[4067,["life is not for getting wretchedness out of you."]],[4070,["What have you gained out of all this running about?"]],[4074,["Nothing."]],[4075,["But this horrible left Nabhi"]],[4077,["by which you are suffering, your family people are suffering."]],[4080,["Only person who has gained"]],[4081,["is the doctor or the doctors or the hospitals.”"]],[4087,["They won't listen."]],[4090,["And you know leukemia is such a fast developing disease of cancer"]],[4095,["that one can pass out within one month,"]],[4099,["doctors will tell you,"]],[4100,["at the most you'll live for one month, that's all. They'll"]],[4102,["take all the money to give this certificate, very nicely."]],[4106,["But why have that?"]],[4108,["Be patient with yourself."]],[4110,["Be kind to your Nabhi, look after your Gruha Lakshmi."]],[4116,["All kinds of diseases of the stomach"]],[4118,["come from this imbalance this way or that way."]],[4123,["All these great gurus came on this earth"]],[4125,["to give us balance, to teach us balance and tell us,"]],[4129,["“Don't do this and don't do that.” All the Ten Commandments."]],[4134,["But to us these Ten Commandment have no meaning."]],[4141,["Now I’ll touch a point which is very important today"]],[4145,["for you people to understand"]],[4147,["about non-vegetarianism and vegetarianism."]],[4151,["Because this subject I wanted to handle,"]],[4153,["because if they are vegetarians they"]],[4155,["can’t bear to see"]],[4156,["that Mother says it doesn't matter if you are a non-vegetarian,"]],[4160,["because it doesn’t go against your awareness. It does not."]],[4164,["But drinking does. Drinking does go against your awareness."]],[4169,["But not eating meat or not eating meat. But one has to understand."]],[4177,["Now somebody told Me that in Gita it is written that those who eat meat"]],[4183,["are Tamo Gunis. I am surprised at Gita itself."]],[4190,["Because Shri Krishna Himself in the very beginning,"]],[4194,["has told Arjuna that you should go all out to kill all these people,"]],[4200,["even your relations, kill, actually kill human beings."]],[4205,["Your relations and your guru also is to be killed,"]],[4209,["because I have already killed."]],[4211,["Nothing is going to be killed by you because they are already killed."]],[4217,["And He gives so many explanations that it should not be done,"]],[4221,["but He said, “No, I tell you, you have to go and kill."]],[4225,["Surrender yourself to Me and I'll take care of them.”"]],[4227,["So how did He preach this, I just don’t understand, in Gita."]],[4231,["Now this seems to be a new introduction"]],[4233,["that the people who eat (meat) are Tamo Gunis. They are not,"]],[4237,["they are never. They are Rajo Gunis."]],[4241,["If you eat meat you become Rajo Gunis not Tamo Gunis."]],[4245,["Tamo Gunis are the people who eat carbohydrates, we have seen it"]],[4248,["in Sahaja Yoga. We have two types of diseases,"]],[4251,["one is lethargic organs and one is active organs."]],[4257,["So those who are lethargic having too much carbohydrates"]],[4265,["and those who are overactive are having too much proteins in them."]],[4271,["I mean if you take proteins, in the science, scientifically,"]],[4275,["will you become lethargic? I mean ask any doctor."]],[4280,["And then the doctor says Gita"]],[4281,["is all humbug because it doesn't understand"]],[4284,["what it is saying."]],[4285,["And while you say like this that “We must follow Gita.”"]],[4289,["I think somebody has gone wrong there"]],[4291,["and has written something wrong in Gita"]],[4293,["as they have written in Bible, they have written in every book."]],[4296,["I'll tell you what they have written wrong in"]],[4298,["Bible later on when it comes to Christ."]],[4301,["I think just some people have put it there for oppose."]],[4306,["If you eat too much meat you get Raj Gunis"]],[4308,["and Raj Gunis become as I have told you right-sided people,"]],[4311,["become very aggressive"]],[4313,["and they become ahamkaris and they can harm."]],[4317,["But the people who just eat grass can become"]],[4320,["lethargic, absolutely lethargic."]],[4323,["They will have lethargic heart if not active one,"]],[4326,["they will also get heart attack."]],[4328,["They will have lethargic intestines by which they will get"]],[4332,["tremendous all the time passing out of the stools,"]],[4334,["they'll never be able to digest any food,"]],[4336,["they'll be very weak people."]],[4339,["So those people who have a lethargic heart or a lethargic"]],[4347,["liver or lethargic intestines should take to proteins."]],[4354,["I'm not saying meats, but proteins."]],[4356,["But a vegetarian doesn't take so much proteins."]],[4359,["It's easier to take meat, there's no harm."]],[4362,["But those who are active people should take"]],[4366,["more to vegetables. It’s sensible."]],[4370,["Guru Nanaka ate all the meats, was he a bad man?"]],[4375,["These Maarwadis who are supposed to be absolutely abstaining"]],[4380,["from even from lahasoon (garlic) and pyaj (onion)."]],[4384,["Was He worse than them by any chance?"]],[4388,["What about Buddha, Himself? He ate meat"]],[4390,["because He died of eating raw meat, Himself."]],[4395,["Only thing you should not eat the meat"]],[4397,["of animals which are bigger than you,"]],[4399,["and not of a cow which is an Indian cow."]],[4402,["Specially Indian cow."]],[4404,["Also bigger cows are not good"]],[4406,["because they give you a problem on the teeth."]],[4412,["But smaller animals, even with Jainism"]],[4417,["they said that you must save the bullocks, the cows,"]],[4427,["and you must save other animals,"]],[4431,["but they never said you must save goats"]],[4433,["and you must save chickens."]],[4436,["Because Mahavira knew we cannot give Realization to chickens."]],[4441,["What is the use of saving chickens and mosquitoes"]],[4444,["and also bugs?"]],[4448,["Of course they are doing like that."]],[4451,["Some Jain people save bugs and"]],[4453,["put it on a human being, and they take the blood of those"]],[4459,["human beings and they are paid for it."]],[4462,["It's absurd but they do it."]],[4464,["For them bugs are more important than human beings."]],[4467,["Billions and billions of bugs cannot make a human being."]],[4473,["All these absurd ideas we have in this country."]],[4477,["So when I say you are not to be a vegetarian"]],[4481,["or non-vegetarian, you have to see what you need and eat that."]],[4484,["But all the time your attention is in food itself is wrong."]],[4491,["So there is no good in you people"]],[4495,["getting into these problems of vegetarianism and non-vegetarianism."]],[4499,["Of course in the Western countries people should take"]],[4503,["to vegetarian food, not absolutely, but more than what they have,"]],[4508,["while the people who are in India who are vegetarians"]],[4512,["will have to later on take to meat. Otherwise"]],[4514,["they will have lethargic heart."]],[4516,["I’ll cure them once again they will have problem,"]],[4518,["then they will have to go for a by-pass. Save money there?"]],[4523,["You cannot. You will have lethargic intestines,"]],[4528,["then you will have lethargic liver. You will have all kinds of"]],[4535,["cirrhosis, or maybe on the hand you might get"]],[4538,["all kinds of rashes and things like that, allergies,"]],[4545,["all these problems will come. And then ultimately such people"]],[4550,["look so peaceful because you see, they are like cabbages."]],[4554,["Yes. If somebody is like a cabbage"]],[4560,["then how do you give him Realization?"]],[4562,["You can't give Realization to cabbages can you?"]],[4566,["We have to have here chivalrous people,"]],[4569,["brave people, warriors."]],[4572,["You have to fight the evil forces, and what can"]],[4576,["these people who are cabbages going to do for it?"]],[4587,["One has to understand yatharth, the reality"]],[4591,["and not put your conception. Because you are born in a Jain family"]],[4597,["and that's why you want everybody to eat grass, is wrong , is wrong."]],[4606,["The one who has to eat protein must eat protein."]],[4612,["Now what is the food for Sattvic people?"]],[4617,["That one should eat. You can’t live with it. So what I eat? Channa."]],[4622,["Can you live with channa? Is protein. Channa, or you can eat meat."]],[4630,["But not very heavy meats, lean meats and ghee,"]],[4643,["and what I eat the most is honey."]],[4651,["That's My food. Honey I eat, you know that, honey I drink."]],[4657,["That's. But you can't live with that can you?"]],[4662,["So you have to eat little carbohydrates. Doesn't matter,"]],[4665,["but you balance yourself in Nabhi Chakra"]],[4671,["But there should be no attention on food at all."]],[4676,["Actually if you ask Me what I ate"]],[4678,["in the morning, I won't be able to tell you."]],[4679,["Really I'm very bad at it because I have no attention on it."]],[4683,["Whatever one gets, eat it, and you don't feel like eating, don't eat."]],[4687,["What's so important is to enjoy every moment of your life."]],[4694,["If a person is finicky about food, specially Indians are,"]],[4697,["is very dangerous for Nabhi Chakra."]],[4700,["Because those who are mad after food"]],[4704,["and about Nabhi Chakra"]],[4708,["are extremely hot-tempered, I think and..."]],[4710,["I don’t know what the word in English is but in"]],[4713,["Hindi we call it chichode,"]],[4719,["irritable, irritable, and these chichode"]],[4724,["will make their wives’ lives miserable."]],[4727,["They will come and tell, “In that house I ate very good curry nuts.”"]],[4731,["So that poor lady is running after the curry nuts."]],[4734,["We Indians are so much food-minded."]],[4738,["You can't imagine, they won't believe we are supposed to be"]],[4740,["starving people."]],[4742,["But we are so food-minded"]],[4744,["that once there was for these Bengalis,"]],[4747,["supposed to be Mukha Bengalis, I must tell you about them."]],[4750,["They had raw fish, raw fish which they get it"]],[4752,["from the Central India"]],[4754,["and people couldn't get fish so they were starving."]],[4757,["So Bombay people very graciously sent"]],[4759,["one shipload, because I know that, I was part of it,"]],[4763,["to them as a gracious act that let the Bengalis eat the fish."]],[4768,["They said, “What? We are not going to eat sea fish,"]],[4771,["we are Bangladeshis.”"]],[4774,["Threw all the fishes in the sea."]],[4776,["It all become sardana (rotten) and it was thrown into the sea."]],[4779,["Can you imagine? Nobody will believe in the West,"]],[4782,["this is how we are fasting and"]],[4784,["that is how we are poor people."]],[4787,["Can poor people afford to throw away one shipload of fish"]],[4792,["in the sea because they want raw fish?"]],[4797,["We are so food-minded that our Nabhis are always like this."]],[4804,["And our women are to be blamed because"]],[4806,["they know to control their husbands, they are spoilt them."]],[4815,["The job of a woman is to be a Gruha Lakshmi."]],[4818,["To have ideals before the family,"]],[4821,["ideals before a husband,"]],[4824,["ideals before the children."]],[4826,["The house should be ideal,"]],[4828,["should be a warm house where everybody's welcome."]],[4832,["The wife’s job is to keep her Nabhi all right,"]],[4835,["the Nabhi of the children all right and the Nabhi of the husband"]],[4839,["and Nabhi of all the people who come to her house."]],[4843,["She has to lead a life of auspiciousness,"]],[4846,["of kindliness, of religious nature. She has to be a soft-natured woman."]],[4855,["But this is all missing, only thing she is worried with,"]],[4859,["how to please the husbands. Because that's one of the big jobs for her."]],[4866,["So to keep our Nabhi all right"]],[4868,["we have to understand as Sahaja Yogis"]],[4871,["that we have not to pay so much attention to food."]],[4877,["That doesn't mean you eat all dirty food."]],[4881,["But it definitely means that when you eat your food,"]],[4884,["you must see the vibrations of the food."]],[4887,["You must always give vibrations to the food."]],[4890,["Eat the food which is vibrated."]],[4893,["Certain foods, now supposing if"]],[4895,["I have to go and eat in any one of these big five star hotels,"]],[4900,["next moment I vomit,"]],[4901,["I always vomit. If somebody invites Me in a hotel,"]],[4905,["I start thinking, ‘Baba, now what an ordeal.’"]],[4908,["Because it is not cooked with love."]],[4913,["That's what it says [Marathi],"]],[4917,["“He likes the little berries of Shabari.”"]],[4922,["[ Marathi]"]],[4932,["Was does that mean?  That means the love"]],[4937,["that is expressed in that food"]],[4942,["is what we should care for,"]],[4949,["and not for the lavishness, not for the show of it"]],[4954,["and not at all for your own taste,"]],[4958,["but the taste of food should be"]],[4960,["that it should carry love. Let your tongue feel the love."]],[4969,["That is the best taste,"]],[4971,["and whatever is cooked with love always tastes very well."]],[4979,["So when you cook,"]],[4981,["cook with love. When you eat, eat with love."]],[4986,["With kind words to the person who has cooked with love"]],[4991,["and above all, count your blessings, count your blessings,"]],[5000,["and think of others who may not have had food today."]],[5006,["This is the Lakshmi Tattwa, is"]],[5008,["where the hand is like this, where it gives"]],[5011,["and there's a hand where it gives protection to people who need money."]],[5017,["But not in a way we do it,"]],[5020,["the way Americans do or Russians do it. We do the way"]],[5023,["Lakshmi does,"]],[5025,["that this protection does not get out of hand."]],[5028,["You give it without telling anyone."]],[5030,["Just because you have to give you give,"]],[5033,["and actually you do that."]],[5035,["If you have given, as My father said, one rupee to someone,"]],[5038,["run away from that person as soon as possible"]],[5043,["with the speed of one mile, he said."]],[5045,["But if you have given"]],[5047,["five rupees, run away from him at the speed of 500 miles."]],[5053,["It's very practical."]],[5056,["That is how we have to give."]],[5058,["This is the Lakshmi Tattwa,"]],[5060,["is the Nabhi Chakra about which I have told you."]],[5064,["It's a very important Chakra,"]],[5067,["because today you are here because in your Chakra,"]],[5073,["Mahalakshmi Tattwa was awakened"]],[5076,["because you wanted to seek God. Because you wanted to come to God."]],[5082,["You have not come here for money."]],[5086,["You have not come here for anything else but God."]],[5091,["Your seeking is in God."]],[5093,["You want to know the truth about God"]],[5095,["and you want to have God."]],[5098,["You don't want to put your ideas on to this,"]],[5101,["but you want to see how Mother wants"]],[5104,["us to receive the blessings of God."]],[5107,["So become that as we seek the love of God, the grace of God."]],[5116,["The Lakshmi has to be gracious and the Mahalakshmi"]],[5121,["is the One who is the gracious lady, is the graciousness in you."]],[5128,["The grace that must come evolved into your personality."]],[5133,["Within that grace he feels the hankering of the Father."]],[5136,["The Father, the Narayana. He wants to have His blessings,"]],[5142,["and that is how the first, the truth,"]],[5145,["the seeking of the truth rises in you,"]],[5148,["and that is how the honesty of seeking is blessed"]],[5152,["when the Kundalini rises."]],[5154,["She first gives you - first thing that you get"]],[5158,["is the truth, by enlightening your brain."]],[5163,["When I will tell you about Sahasrara"]],[5166,["and about Agnya, I will tell you how this brain becomes"]],[5174,["a receptor of the ultimate truth,"]],[5178,["how truth is spread, you start"]],[5182,["receiving the knowledge of absolute truth."]],[5186,["How this brain when enlightened"]],[5189,["gives you the power to know what is truth and what is not truth,"]],[5198,["and there are no alternatives."]],[5203,["This I'll tell you later on"]],[5205,["when the Kundalini I'll describe at the brain level."]],[5209,["But for today I think Nabhi Chakra is very important."]],[5214,["For all of us, for India specially,"]],[5216,["our Nabhi Chakra is very important,"]],[5220,["that we should know that God Almighty,"]],[5223,["the Narayana, the Vishnu,"]],[5228,["is the One who gives the kshema after Yoga."]],[5232,["He says, “Yoga Kshema Mahatmyam,” He gives the kshema."]],[5237,["And we are sinning against the God"]],[5240,["when we don't believe that honest and"]],[5244,["righteous and virtuous life will give us the kshema"]],[5248,["as promised by God Almighty."]],[5250,["You are sinning against our Father, while in the West"]],[5254,["they are sinning against the Mother"]],[5257,["on the left hand side,"]],[5259,["because they have forgotten that immoral life"]],[5263,["is an insult to the Mother Power of God."]],[5268,["So both things are important,"]],[5270,["whether in the West or East, is important"]],[5274,["that we should not sin against the Father and sin against the Mother."]],[5280,["I hope I've tried to tell you everything"]],[5284,["in such a way that you do not feel hurt."]],[5286,["Because all of you come from different, different"]],[5289,["types of lives; different, different conceptions;"]],[5293,["different, different gurus, and you can get confused about it."]],[5298,["So, in Sahaja Yoga you should"]],[5300,["allow this to work out."]],[5303,["Allow the light to come in and don't get confused, don't get upset."]],[5307,["Here you are to seek God"]],[5310,["and not to sit on what you have known so far,"]],[5313,["or which you have heard so far, or whatever you have followed."]],[5316,["Because that has not given you anything whatsoever."]],[5321,["Like one of My disciples who's a big officer"]],[5327,["and one day he told Me, “Mother,"]],[5329,["I don't know about Gita,"]],[5331,["I don't know about Ramana, Krishna, anyone."]],[5335,["I know You, because You are the One who has given me Realization.”"]],[5342,["Of course after knowing Me you will know all of them."]],[5346,["But it is better you know Me now, because"]],[5348,["Those are no more here. It is I Who is sitting here,"]],[5351,["so better know Me first,"]],[5353,["and then you will know Them better"]],[5355,["than what you have known Them before."]],[5358,["So let us compromise in this point:"]],[5361,["that try to understand it through Sahaja Yoga."]],[5364,["Everything can be proved. Whatever I have said is absolute truth,"]],[5368,["nothing but the truth."]],[5370,["But you allow yourself not to be bound by any"]],[5375,["previous ideas and previous conceptions."]],[5378,["But let it be open mind to see what I've said,"]],[5381,["it's just a hypothesis, let it become a law."]],[5385,["When you see it yourself, when it becomes in your heart,"]],[5388,["on the vibrations, when you see and judge what I've said,"]],[5392,["you'll be amazed that Nabhi Chakra which you feel on these fingers,"]],[5400,["even the children can tell you."]],[5403,["May God bless you all. Thank you very much."]],[5409,["Tomorrow I'll tell you about other chakra called"]],[5413,["the Chakra of the Devi, Herself ."]],[5423,["If there are any questions, I've told you, you better write it down."]],[5426,["It's always worked out very well."]],[5428,["I think now we should go in for meditation and try"]],[5432,["to get your Realization."]],[5463,["Will you please put your hands towards Me,"]],[5468,["like this, just in humble way."]],[5471,["Because you have not known so far, and you will know it"]],[5476,["when you will know it: So you put your hands towards Me like this"]],[5482,["and as I've told you these are"]],[5483,["five chakras, sixth and seventh chakra is here is on our hands."]],[5486,["Five chakras, sixth and seventh."]],[5491,["I must tell you today I met"]],[5493,["some Kashmiri Muslims, that's a good idea."]],[5495,["Suddenly they did feel for Me something. I don't know how."]],[5499,["And they said, “Are You the Mother?”"]],[5501,["I said, “Yes, I am.” They came to Me"]],[5505,["and then said that “You must tell us about Ruh, about Ruh,"]],[5509,["about spiritual life, about Spirit.”"]],[5512,["They came to Me. I said,"]],[5513,["“All right, you put your hands towards Me like this.”"]],[5515,["They put their hands towards Me and they felt the cool breeze."]],[5519,["And they said, “This is what it is. Mohammed has said"]],[5522,["that your hands will speak. This is it. That's the truth.”"]],[5527,["I said, “Yes,"]],[5531,["when you have your second birth,"]],[5533,["you’ll be rid of all the nonsense of"]],[5536,["these so-called religions which are separating you."]],[5541,["They were never meant to be separated,"]],[5543,["they were meant to integrate you. But you have done it, doesn't matter."]],[5547,["Now by God's grace Sahaja Yoga has come, you'll have second birth."]],[5552,["So all the things that are attached to your birth"]],[5555,["will be finished and you’ll be a new person having a new life in which"]],[5562,["you forget all that is attacking you,"]],[5566,["is attached to you, which is dragging you,"]],[5569,["which is making you think, think, think but not ascend.”"]],[5576,["I'm very happy, these simple Muslims who met Me, they were in a shop"]],[5580,["selling something, and they were so sweet and so beautiful."]],[5588,["They didn't say that “You are not Mohammed.” Nothing of the kind."]],[5590,["They said, “This is what Mohammed has said,"]],[5592,["that “At the time of the Resurrection, your hands will speak,”"]],[5596,["and what are these people fighting for?”"]],[5602,["You see. This is what it is."]],[5608,["May God bless you all!"]],[5615,["Let us have now both the hands towards Me and close your eyes"]],[5620,["just close your eyes."]],[5622,["[Shri Mataji gives Realization.]"]]]);
